{"5070200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Video Game Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 5070200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5070230], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Video Game Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.webm?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.mp4?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Turn an empty shop into a thriving destination for gamers. In Video Game Store Simulator, you manage every part of the business from a first-person perspective. Choose what to sell, order inventory, unpack deliveries, arrange your store, set prices, and serve customers at the checkout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock the Games Players Love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/9f863f29f39151780635915840d271d1.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/9f863f29f39151780635915840d271d1.webm?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/9f863f29f39151780635915840d271d1.mp4?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Browse the product catalog, unlock new titles, and order games for your store. Unpack deliveries by hand, organize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  your inventory, and keep the shelves stocked with the games your customers want to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Pay attention to demand, adjust your selection, and make sure every customer can find something worth taking home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Checkout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/ec9b744b61032540a0421662eadf9248.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/ec9b744b61032540a0421662eadf9248.webm?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/ec9b744b61032540a0421662eadf9248.mp4?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Open your store and watch customers browse the shelves. Scan their purchases, accept cash or card payments, give the correct change, and keep the checkout line moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fast and accurate service helps your store operate smoothly and keeps customers satisfied.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design and Expand Your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/a121a18e608306305eeab6fd86212f37.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/a121a18e608306305eeab6fd86212f37.webm?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/a121a18e608306305eeab6fd86212f37.mp4?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Purchase shelves, checkout counters, storage racks, and other furniture. Place and rearrange each item to create an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  efficient store layout, customize the look of your shop, and unlock additional space as your business grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Set your own selling prices and balance profit margins against customer demand. Track daily revenue and expenses,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  unlock new product licenses, and reinvest your earnings in inventory, equipment, and store expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every decision shapes the future of your business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a video game store from a first-person perspective</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products, unpack deliveries, and stock shelves by hand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which games to sell based on customer demand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set selling prices and manage profit margins</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan purchases and process cash or card payments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase, place, and rearrange store furniture</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new games, equipment, licenses, and store expansions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track expenses, sales, and daily revenue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store and improve its layout as it grows</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The following features are planned for future updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to handle checkout, restocking, cleaning, and security</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage staff roles and automate everyday store tasks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay recurring business bills and operating costs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply for and repay business loans</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the financial management and progression systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Video Game Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.webm?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/8587412044712ae428ea96c5acb6a14b.mp4?t=1787909749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Turn an empty shop into a thriving destination for gamers. In Video Game Store Simulator, you manage every part of the business from a first-person perspective. Choose what to sell, order inventory, unpack deliveries, arrange your store, set prices, and serve customers at the checkout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock the Games Players Love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5070200/extras/9f863f29f39151780635915840d271d1.poster.avif?t=1787909749\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"ht